**/.env
**/.env.*
**/appsettings.Development.json
**/secrets.json
**/google-services.json
**/*firebase-adminsdk*.json
**/local.properties

# maya-client: Android native & artefak lokal tidak dibutuhkan untuk build web
maya-client/android
maya-client/node_modules
maya-client/dist

